This repository includes the Rowing Stroke Capture Format (RSCF), an open
file format for per-stroke rowing data including full force curve capture.
RSCF is intended to be freely implementable by anyone. See
docs/collector-app-spec.md for the format specification and its
royalty-free implementation grant.
